sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant RN as React Native App
  participant SQLite as Mobile SQLite
  participant API as Medusa Sync API
  participant WF as pushMutations Workflow
  participant Sync as Sync Module
  participant Domain as Domain Workflows
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  RN->>SQLite: Queue mutation with UUID and idempotency key
  RN->>API: POST /api/v1/sync/push when network returns
  API->>API: Validate tenant, device and cursor
  API->>WF: Mutation batch
  WF->>Sync: Check idempotency and ordering
  loop each mutation
    WF->>Domain: Execute target workflow
    Domain->>PG: Persist accepted change
  end
  WF->>Sync: Record conflicts or failures
  API-->>RN: Ack, conflicts and next cursor
  RN->>SQLite: Mark synced, failed or needs review
